      en: ["The Mali Bajmok Free Zone was established in its current form in 2010.", "Siemens produces about 25% of all wind turbine generators globally here.", "The industrial zone employs over 6,000 local and regional workers.", "It offers a customs-free regime for imports intended for export production.", "The location is just 10 km from the Hungarian border and EU market.", "Major investors include Swarovski, Continental, Dunkermotoren, and Ametek."],
