      en: ["Founding of the Krušik defense factory in 1939.", "Gorenje (Hisense) opened its first plant in Valjevo in 2006.", "Significant center for the export of frozen fruits (raspberries).", "The city is located at the intersection of the planned M-4 expressway.", "Over 3,000 employees work in the metal processing sector.", "Krušik produces ammunition and rocket systems for over 70 countries."],
