      en: ["The Mitros meat factory was established in 1953 and later acquired by Austrian Gierlinger.", "Sremska Mitrovica is located just 75 km from Belgrade on the E70 motorway.", "Eaton manufactures power distribution equipment in its large local facility.", "The city's port on the Sava River handles bulk cargo for regional industry.", "Over 100 hectares of land have been developed for industrial use since 2000.", "The manufacturing sector accounts for the largest share of local employment."],
      es: ["El parque industrial abarca 120 hectáreas.", "Más de 50 empresas tienen su sede en el parque.", "Trabajan unas 4.000 personas.", "La producción anual es de 500 millones de euros.", "El parque está a 60 km de Belgrado.", "En 2022 se inauguró una nueva fábrica de componentes automotrices con 500 puestos de trabajo."],
