      en: ["The Dijamant factory is the leading producer of sunflower oil in the Western Balkans.", "There are approximately 80,000 hectares of high-quality arable land surrounding Zrenjanin.", "Industrial-scale food processing in the area dates back to the mid-19th century.", "The Bega Canal has been a vital transport route for agricultural goods since 1728.", "Agriculture and related industries account for about 30% of the local GDP.", "Zrenjanin is a major center for the production of bio-ethanol and corn-based products."],
